#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2696 bdabac7bd5b7466baa55bb2b63b1b41a
msgid ""
"Surfaced by running the full build as the last step of A-95 -- the "
"promotion was the reason a green suite mattered, and there was none. The "
"largest cluster is `Protection.*` (13 cases), and it is a real logic "
"failure, not instrumentation: "
"`EveryFaultIsClassifiedAsItselfAndNothingElse` prints \"5\" against "
