" other words the assertion encoded \"this platform's trig must be at "
"least as inaccurate as glibc's\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2892 48f2b755ec3e421582d0f5e34b6d9e61
msgid ""
"Surfaced by the platform matrix, not by review: `Tests / Auto Testing "
