" `Expected: (part_fit) > (0.0F), actual: 0 vs 0`. The case had been "
"reported green locally for a day, and locally it *is* green -- Linux is "
"the platform where the noise is non-zero. A single-platform pass was "
"never evidence about this assertion."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2897 be00fde7412d4760a5fc58dd6451bf70
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Blast radius is small in files and large in kind: three of the assertions"
" added in this session were comparative (`x > k * y`) where `y` sat at or"
" near a noise floor, and the other two were removed in the same edit "
